OL,3,GNEWSAStudents run for BBC Children in
OL,4,ANeed challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren at a school in Surrey have
OL,7,Fraised more than #1,500 for BBC
OL,8,FChildren in Need through a series of
OL,9,Ffitness challenges.
OL,11,FYoung people at Godstone Primary and
OL,12,FNursery School have been fundraising
OL,13,Ffor the charity by running in the
OL,14,Flead-up to its main appeal day on
OL,15,FFriday.
OL,17,FThey joined Robin Grey, BBC Radio
OL,18,FSurrey and Sussex's sports editor, for
OL,19,Fthe final two miles of his own 26-mile
OL,20,Frunning challenge.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
