OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStudents run for BBC Children in
OL,4,ANeed challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FWatching them do laps of the school's
OL,7,Fplayground, headteacher Nick Usher told
OL,8,FBBC Radio Surrey: "I think that's a key
OL,9,Fthing about BBC Children in Need for
OL,10,Fthe children - they're able to
OL,11,Funderstand where that money is going
OL,12,Fand how they can help other people."
